---

<svg
    width={size}
    height={size}
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    class="icon"
    aria-hidden="true"
    set:html={paths[name]}
/>
